### 1. Codec (`IXWebSocketPerMessageDeflateCodec.cpp`)
In `decompress`, on zlib error, clear `out` before returning false:
```cpp
if (ret == Z_NEED_DICT || ret == Z_DATA_ERROR || ret == Z_MEM_ERROR)
{
    out.clear(); // do not leak partially decompressed data on failure
    return false;
}
```
This satisfies "输出字符串必须为空，即使错误发生前已经解出超过16384字节" (buffer is 16384 = 1<<14, so partial output > 16384 possible across loop iterations).

